---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Reviews & Comparisons | TechPilot AI" description="Evaluate technology tools with practical criteria, transparent trade-offs, and clear comparisons.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Choose with confidence</span>
    <h1>Reviews with <span style="color:var(--mint)">the trade-offs included.</span></h1>
    <p>The best tool depends on your needs, budget, workflow, and privacy expectations. Our review framework puts those details beside the features.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="notice">Review framework: we aim to distinguish verified product information from hands-on observations and editorial opinion. Pricing, plans, and features may change; check providers for the latest details.</div>
  <div class="section-heading"><div><h2>What we compare</h2><p>A useful evaluation goes beyond a feature list.</p></div></div>
  <section class="card-grid">
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">⚖</span><span class="card-tag">Side by side</span><h3>Tool comparisons</h3><p>Compare workflows, strengths, limitations, accessibility, and costs for the task you need to complete.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">◉</span><span class="card-tag">Practical fit</span><h3>Who is it for?</h3><p>Understand which users may benefit most, which needs may not be met, and what alternatives to consider.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">⌁</span><span class="card-tag">Total cost</span><h3>Plans & limitations</h3><p>Look beyond headline prices to usage limits, paid features, data policies, and cancellation terms.</p></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
